  <!-- EN: Pick a tile on the world map, then the depth to end at:
- This tile: change cruising depth, surface, or break through the ice
- A neighbouring sea tile: anchor
- An existing site: dock; once there and at its seafloor depth, choose where the hull stops
- Any other sea tile: plan a voyage; confirming it starts the launch sequence
Under way it changes the depth to end at; on the surface it picks how deep to dive. Each depth tier takes an hour, never below the seafloor, and the hull must be rated for it.

Seafloor here: {0}
Hull rating: {1} -->
